# Agent-local issue tracker state. Tracked here rather than left to each
# clone's .git/info/exclude, because `.beads/redirect` is a routing pointer
# whose correct value depends on how deep the clone sits: a crew clone needs
# `../../.beads`, a polecat clone `../../../.beads`. A committed copy applied
# to another workspace re-points that agent's `bd` at a different database and
# nothing errors -- the ids just come back with the wrong prefix (hy-fwr).
.beads/

# Generated by `make demo-generate-export` (hy-gh-37) -- regenerable
# real-source Superset export, not source to track.
/demo/
